title:    How the implementation is organised
subtitle: Major directories only. Full source on GitHub.
width:    760
---
week-02-keyless-ci/
├── LAB.md              reproduction guide: the attribute condition, the phase split
├── terraform/          the pool, the provider, two identities, their grants
├── scripts/            validate.sh - including the shortcut, attempted
└── docs/               figure plan, references, screenshots

# terraform/  main.tf has grown every week since: it is the human-run layer
#             where CI's permissions are defined, so later weeks add here.
# scripts/    validate.sh attempts key creation and expects a refusal - the
#             one check that tests the control rather than the config.
